   "jp": "鍛冶屋の外",
   "en": "Go outside",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES05:14b47",
   "off": 84807,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「武器や防具が欲しけりゃ\r  店の方へいってくれ\u0010\b  城から 大量の注文が\r  きてるんで 大忙しだ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"If you want weapons or armour, go round to the shop.\u0010\bWe're swamped with a huge order from the castle.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES05:14ba9",
   "off": 84905,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「どんなことがあっても\r  私は ここで鍛冶を続ける\r  つもりだ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Whatever happens, I mean to keep smithing right here.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES05:14bf3",
   "off": 84979,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「こんなにでかいヨロイを\r  どうするんだろう\u0010\b  とても普通の人間用とは\r  思えないよ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"What would anyone do with armour this big?\u0010\bIt can't be meant for any ordinary person.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES05:14c4e",
   "off": 85070,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「私は師匠についていく\r  だけですよ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"I'll stick with my master.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
